<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alliance Capital upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alliance Capital upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it upgraded Alliance Capital Management LP to a buy from a neutral rating.</p>
<p>--Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
